WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.117 --> 00:00:16.880
Ben blinked in surprise as he looked from the gold jewelry to Dr.

2
00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:20.621
Bones. The guards rushed toward her.

3
00:00:20.641 --> 00:00:23.282
"Where's the rest of the loot?"

4
00:00:23.622 --> 00:00:24.462
Hazel demanded.

5
00:00:24.482 --> 00:00:26.883
"Confess!" Dr.

6
00:00:26.923 --> 00:00:27.903
Bones scowled.

7
00:00:27.923 --> 00:00:29.624
"This is ridiculous.

8
00:00:30.196 --> 00:00:32.798
Why would I steal from my own museum?"

9
00:00:32.818 --> 00:00:38.523
"Maybe the museum isn't paying you enough," Bob suggested.

10
00:00:38.543 --> 00:00:41.846
"Maybe she's trying to make monsters look bad!"

11
00:00:42.226 --> 00:00:43.427
Mr. Freaky snapped.

12
00:00:44.248 --> 00:00:45.489
"This is absurd!"

13
00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:48.732
Dr. Bones said, sighing.

14
00:00:48.752 --> 00:00:50.853
"I'm going to call the police.

15
00:00:51.314 --> 00:00:53.175
They'll find the real culprit."

16
00:00:56.198 --> 00:00:57.339
"Stay right there!"

17
00:00:57.779 --> 00:00:58.480
ordered Bob.

18
00:01:02.647 --> 00:01:03.528
He pushed Dr.

19
00:01:03.568 --> 00:01:04.669
Bones into a chair.

20
00:01:08.892 --> 00:01:13.156
Ben watched the two guards huddle, listening as they whispered back and forth.

21
00:01:13.176 --> 00:01:15.838
"It's too soon to call the police."

22
00:01:15.858 --> 00:01:21.902
"If we can find the rest of the loot, the mayor will probably give us a reward!"

23
00:01:22.903 --> 00:01:25.505
Mr. Freaky's face was turning redder and redder.

24
00:01:25.525 --> 00:01:27.467
"Call the police right now!"

25
00:01:27.827 --> 00:01:28.468
he demanded.

26
00:01:29.032 --> 00:01:32.615
"If you don't, I'm going to take all the students back to Monsterville!"

27
00:01:34.276 --> 00:01:36.578
"You're not going anywhere, buddy!"

28
00:01:36.939 --> 00:01:37.919
Hazel snarled.

29
00:01:37.939 --> 00:01:41.322
"We have a plan," the other guard said.

30
00:01:41.342 --> 00:01:45.486
"We'll call the police if we don't find the jewels by morning."

31
00:01:45.506 --> 00:01:48.388
"You can't hold us here all night!"

32
00:01:48.948 --> 00:01:50.310
Dr. Bones complained.

33
00:01:50.330 --> 00:01:52.511
"Yes, we can."

34
00:01:53.132 --> 00:01:53.872
Bob grinned.

35
00:01:53.892 --> 00:01:57.896
"We'll lock you in the Old West jail exhibit."

36
00:02:00.984 --> 00:02:02.285
"What about those zombies?"

37
00:02:02.745 --> 00:02:03.365
Ben said.

38
00:02:04.226 --> 00:02:05.086
Hazel shrugged.

39
00:02:05.106 --> 00:02:09.589
"The only zombies I see are the ones in your group."

40
00:02:09.609 --> 00:02:13.691
"Grr!" Ben growled with frustration.

41
00:02:13.711 --> 00:02:15.752
"This is an outrage!"

42
00:02:16.233 --> 00:02:17.874
Mr. Freaky stamped a foot.

43
00:02:18.334 --> 00:02:20.835
"Wait till Mayor Hubbletree hears how we've been treated.

44
00:02:21.416 --> 00:02:23.777
He said people would be friendly and kind.

45
00:02:24.237 --> 00:02:27.799
But instead we've been treated like—" "Monsters!"

46
00:02:28.279 --> 00:02:29.000
Bob snapped.

47
00:02:34.788 --> 00:02:36.590
The guards left Ben and Dr.

48
00:02:36.650 --> 00:02:38.231
Bones in the director's office.

49
00:02:39.873 --> 00:02:44.216
They locked the rest of the monsters in the classrooms and then grabbed Ben and Dr.

50
00:02:44.236 --> 00:02:47.920
Bones. "We're taking you to jail!"

51
00:02:48.360 --> 00:02:49.020
Hazel said.

52
00:02:52.083 --> 00:02:57.608
They dragged their prisoners to the Old West exhibit, and then hurried off to search for Egyptian treasure.

53
00:02:59.404 --> 00:03:01.305
Dr. Bones had been very quiet.

54
00:03:05.408 --> 00:03:07.490
guards aren't very smart," Ben said.

55
00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:08.931
"I'm a ghost.

56
00:03:09.291 --> 00:03:11.993
I can float out of this fake jail cell whenever I want."

57
00:03:12.974 --> 00:03:15.095
Dr. Bones sighed.

58
00:03:15.115 --> 00:03:17.297
"This is the mayor's fault.

59
00:03:17.917 --> 00:03:21.079
He's the one who cut the museum's budget last year.

60
00:03:22.580 --> 00:03:27.684
We couldn't afford real security guards, so I had to hire those two."

61
00:03:28.364 --> 00:03:29.424
"Did you steal the jewels?"

62
00:03:29.824 --> 00:03:30.605
Ben blurted out.

63
00:03:30.625 --> 00:03:32.825
"Of course not!"

64
00:03:33.185 --> 00:03:34.206
Dr. Bones snapped.

65
00:03:34.566 --> 00:03:36.546
"Why would I leave one in my coat?

66
00:03:37.026 --> 00:03:38.867
And where are the rest of them?"

67
00:03:39.527 --> 00:03:41.948
Ben rested his chin in his hands, thinking.

68
00:03:41.968 --> 00:03:46.189
"We'll just have to wait for the police," Dr.

69
00:03:46.229 --> 00:03:46.849
Bones said.

70
00:03:46.869 --> 00:03:52.331
"If we wait for the police," Ben said, "the real crooks might get away.

71
00:03:52.351 --> 00:03:56.332
The real thieves could even be working with those guards!"

72
00:03:58.612 --> 00:04:00.354
Dr. Bones' eyes went wide.

73
00:04:00.374 --> 00:04:02.816
"You're right!

74
00:04:04.117 --> 00:04:07.499
Uh-oh. They could all escape while we're stuck in here.

75
00:04:08.240 --> 00:04:09.661
We have to do something."

76
00:04:10.922 --> 00:04:11.983
Ben had an idea.

77
00:04:12.003 --> 00:04:17.628
"When the alarm went off, did you see any zombies run through the construction site?"

78
00:04:23.012 --> 00:04:24.393
Dr. Bones shook her head.

79
00:04:24.413 --> 00:04:30.446
"No." "Well, then the real thieves must still be in the museum."

80
00:04:31.647 --> 00:04:33.688
Ben floated through the bars of the jail cell.

81
00:04:33.708 --> 00:04:34.749
"Don't worry.

82
00:04:35.029 --> 00:04:35.790
I'll be back soon."

83
00:04:37.311 --> 00:04:39.493
"I'm not sure this is a good idea!"

84
00:04:39.893 --> 00:04:40.954
Dr. Bones called.

85
00:04:41.634 --> 00:04:44.716
But Ben was already floating through the museum to the lobby.

86
00:04:44.736 --> 00:04:50.761
"The thieves went into the construction area," he murmured.

87
00:04:50.781 --> 00:04:54.904
"But they didn't come out in the education wing.

88
00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:59.062
Maybe they're hiding inside the construction area."

89
00:05:00.283 --> 00:05:05.768
Ben drifted into the construction area, searching among the tools and scaffolding for clues.

90
00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:12.053
He spotted some old clothes and masks in a trash bucket.

91
00:05:12.073 --> 00:05:14.335
"Whoa!" he cried.

92
00:05:14.355 --> 00:05:16.757
"Those are zombie costumes!"

93
00:05:16.777 --> 00:05:21.361
"Ben?" someone called.

94
00:05:21.781 --> 00:05:22.461
Ben looked up.

95
00:05:22.962 --> 00:05:25.224
Winnie and Cleo were hurrying toward him.

96
00:05:25.704 --> 00:05:28.786
Behind them was Waldo, hobbling on his sore ankle.

97
00:05:34.649 --> 00:05:37.331
zapped the door locks open," Waldo explained.

98
00:05:37.351 --> 00:05:40.973
"We went to the Old West exhibit," said Winnie.

99
00:05:40.993 --> 00:05:44.855
"Dr. Bones told us you were searching the museum."

100
00:05:46.916 --> 00:05:48.577
Ben pointed to the trash can.

101
00:05:48.597 --> 00:05:50.799
"I found some disguises.

102
00:05:51.139 --> 00:05:52.860
The zombies are people!"

103
00:05:54.888 --> 00:05:55.749
"Those creeps!"

104
00:05:56.129 --> 00:05:56.829
Cleo said.

105
00:05:56.849 --> 00:06:01.792
"The two security guards are looking around the museum too," Ben said.

106
00:06:01.812 --> 00:06:06.255
"They think they can get a reward, or a—" "Shh!"

107
00:06:06.655 --> 00:06:07.956
Winnie hushed him.

108
00:06:07.976 --> 00:06:10.597
"Do you hear voices?"

109
00:06:10.837 --> 00:06:11.658
Ben nodded.

110
00:06:11.678 --> 00:06:15.280
"How long do we have to wait here?"

111
00:06:15.780 --> 00:06:16.821
a man was complaining.

112
00:06:16.841 --> 00:06:19.882
"Until tomorrow morning," said another voice.

113
00:06:19.902 --> 00:06:23.180
"Then we show up like it's a regular workday.

114
00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:26.722
When no one is looking, we'll sneak out and never come back."

115
00:06:27.623 --> 00:06:31.405
"Ha-ha! We'll never have to see that snooty Dr.

116
00:06:31.485 --> 00:06:34.527
Bones or ask for a raise again!"

117
00:06:34.547 --> 00:06:37.249
"Because she'll be in jail!"

118
00:06:37.749 --> 00:06:38.809
said the second voice.

119
00:06:39.450 --> 00:06:40.370
Ben looked around.

120
00:06:41.491 --> 00:06:45.073
The voices seemed to be coming from inside a newly built wall.

121
00:06:45.894 --> 00:06:47.475
Were the thieves hiding inside?
